ink" href="/encyclopedia/malik-kafur">Malik Kafur</a> captures the Hoysala capital <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dwarasamudra">Dwarasamudra</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1343</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/veera-ballala-iii">Veera Ballala III</a> is killed fighting the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/madurai-sultanate">Madurai Sultanate</a></span></li></ol>
